Thank you for the nice job!

The OpenVPN v2.1_rc1 works as a client on winXP-SP2 fine.
A non-administrative user is able to start and connect with it (OpenVPN  
GUI) - unless the server's configuration PUSH'es him the  
"redirect-gateway" option.
On winXP such a push is successful only if a user is a member of the  
"Network Configuration Operators" group also (not just a plain "User") - I  
believe it is not purely OpenVPN limitation, right?

Again, thank you for the fine product!!!

Tony.


